{"5028190": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "WaveBorn", "steam_appid": 5028190, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5128270], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MASSIVE, MERCILESS HORDES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the terror of facing <strong>thousands of enemies</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028190/extras/b2efc6addd19835648fc361556d84b0c.poster.avif?t=1788158285\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028190/extras/b2efc6addd19835648fc361556d84b0c.webm?t=1788158285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028190/extras/b2efc6addd19835648fc361556d84b0c.mp4?t=1788158285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A BESTIARY THAT SHOWS NO MERCY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemies</strong> with behaviors of their own: enemies that burst on death, flyers that harass you from above, chargers that never hit the brakes, specters that phase through the geometry and shielded juggernauts that soak up magazine after magazine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ELITES AND AFFIXES</strong> that combine with one another: corrupting auras, enraged brutes, veterans that run faster than you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ELEMENTAL STATUS EFFECTS</strong>: burn them, freeze them and sow plagues that spread from body to body on their own.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COLOSSAL BOSSES</strong> with phases of their own, each one waiting at the end of the road.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028190/extras/d77aa3c7c272ea3b31c240e5ae6e5072.poster.avif?t=1788158285\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028190/extras/d77aa3c7c272ea3b31c240e5ae6e5072.webm?t=1788158285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028190/extras/d77aa3c7c272ea3b31c240e5ae6e5072.mp4?t=1788158285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEVASTATING ARSENAL AND MODIFIER SYSTEM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield an arsenal of <strong>14 unique weapons</strong>, from plasma pistols and double-barreled shotguns to flamethrowers, RPG rocket launchers and the lethal <i>Railgun</i>, and twist them with <strong>over 300 firing modifiers</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explosive bullets. Voltaic arcs. Toxic clouds. Freezing impacts. Napalm pools. Projectiles that bounce between skulls, punch through entire ranks or hunt down their next victim on their own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028190/extras/f4bf03d95802aaf18f67d8eff4051ca6.poster.avif?t=1788158285\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028190/extras/f4bf03d95802aaf18f67d8eff4051ca6.webm?t=1788158285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028190/extras/f4bf03d95802aaf18f67d8eff4051ca6.mp4?t=1788158285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GALACTIC FORGE AND THE FATE CHEST</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebuild your playstyle in the middle of the chaos. Buy weaponry from the <strong>machines scattered across the map</strong>, push your luck at the <strong>Fate Chest</strong> or take your weapon to the <strong>GALACTIC FORGE</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028190/extras/2ea898df2b3889d34a3ad09a289c32f6.poster.avif?t=1788158285\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028190/extras/2ea898df2b3889d34a3ad09a289c32f6.webm?t=1788158285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028190/extras/2ea898df2b3889d34a3ad09a289c32f6.mp4?t=1788158285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TEMPT THE VOID</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If luck is on your side, you can land <strong>exclusive skins</strong> and who knows, maybe get rich along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028190/extras/9cf6cb2dee0832e9dc55afc14749c517.poster.avif?t=1788158285\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028190/extras/9cf6cb2dee0832e9dc55afc14749c517.webm?t=1788158285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028190/extras/9cf6cb2dee0832e9dc55afc14749c517.mp4?t=1788158285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PERMANENT PROGRESSION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every run counts.</strong> Head back to your <strong>CENTRAL GARAGE</strong> and invest the resources you earned into a sprawling <strong>Skill Tree</strong>: permanent upgrades to damage, health, speed and lethality that stay with you from the next incursion onwards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test builds without limits at the <strong>shooting range</strong>, unlock new machines and decide which face you're wearing this time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028190/extras/1cc85bd36cb99dfbe9c00b578641898b.poster.avif?t=1788158285\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028190/extras/1cc85bd36cb99dfbe9c00b578641898b.webm?t=1788158285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028190/extras/1cc85bd36cb99dfbe9c00b578641898b.mp4?t=1788158285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>14 unique weapons</strong> and <strong>over 300 combinable modifiers</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dozens of enemies</strong> and <strong>bosses</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenges</strong> and exclusive <strong>skins</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permanent progression</strong> across several branches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboards</strong> to compete against the world and your friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Constantly expanding</strong> content</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MASSIVE, MERCILESS HORDES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the terror of facing <strong>thousands of enemies</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps